WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.148 --> 00:00:15.389
Ben was still staring at Winnie's cousin.

2
00:00:15.409 --> 00:00:18.291
"Aren't you going to introduce me?"

3
00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:20.213
he said, nudging Winnie gently.

4
00:00:20.913 --> 00:00:21.594
She sighed.

5
00:00:21.614 --> 00:00:26.037
"Ben, this is my cousin Serena.

6
00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:28.498
Serena, this is my friend Ben."

7
00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:30.180
Ben felt a little hurt.

8
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.982
Winnie usually introduced him as her boyfriend.

9
00:00:34.002 --> 00:00:39.167
"It's nice to meet you, Ben," Serena said.

10
00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.992
She flashed a dazzling smile at him, and he felt himself blushing from head to toe.

11
00:00:45.012 --> 00:00:51.217
"Thanks! It's amazing to meet Ben let his words trail off as Winnie glared at him.

12
00:00:51.237 --> 00:00:55.080
"It's nice to meet you too," he mumbled.

13
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.722
"Where were you, Serena?"

14
00:00:58.043 --> 00:00:59.244
Winnie asked with a frown.

15
00:01:00.836 --> 00:01:05.459
"You were supposed to sign in at the main office and then meet me outside the auditorium for

16
00:01:05.499 --> 00:01:06.219
the pep rally.

17
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.460
I waited and waited for you.

18
00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:14.064
You made me late for the pep rally—I missed most of the cheers."

19
00:01:17.686 --> 00:01:20.047
"Sorry about that," Serena said.

20
00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:25.230
"I headed to the pep rally after I went to the main office.

21
00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:28.872
But all these monsters kept stopping to talk to me."

22
00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:32.513
Winnie let out another big sigh.

23
00:01:32.533 --> 00:01:36.995
"Well, we need to go upstairs now.

24
00:01:39.196 --> 00:01:43.638
I have to get my broom from the broom-flying classroom before it gets locked for the day."

25
00:01:45.578 --> 00:01:47.979
She grabbed Serena's arm and dragged her away.

26
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:58.264
"Hey, Winnie," Ben began.

27
00:01:59.372 --> 00:02:00.853
"Can we talk about Field Day again?

28
00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:03.015
I just wanted—" "I'm busy, Ben!"

29
00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:04.336
Winnie said loudly.

30
00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:06.477
"Didn't you hear me say that before?"

31
00:02:06.497 --> 00:02:12.041
"Yes, but Ben's words trailed off as the two witches disappeared into the hallway.

32
00:02:14.383 --> 00:02:15.924
He ran a hand through his hair.

33
00:02:15.944 --> 00:02:18.105
"Mog is right," he thought.

34
00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:20.607
"Winnie is acting really weird today."

35
00:02:22.068 --> 00:02:25.810
His thoughts flashed back to Winnie's laughing and smiling with Zork.

36
00:02:26.271 --> 00:02:27.692
She'd seemed fine then.

37
00:02:29.264 --> 00:02:32.947
Suddenly Ben felt a large hand clamp down on his shoulder.

38
00:02:34.088 --> 00:02:34.749
It was Mog's.

39
00:02:34.769 --> 00:02:36.830
"Ready for practice, Ben?"

40
00:02:37.151 --> 00:02:37.911
Mog asked.

41
00:02:37.931 --> 00:02:42.575
"Team Black had better practice today, or Zork's team will beat us."

42
00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.196
"No, they won't!"

43
00:02:44.396 --> 00:02:45.297
Ben burst out.

44
00:02:45.317 --> 00:02:47.499
"Team Black is going to win!"

45
00:02:47.519 --> 00:02:51.602
"That's what I call team spirit," Mog said.

46
00:02:52.863 --> 00:02:54.284
They headed toward the gym.

47
00:02:54.304 --> 00:02:57.247
"Did you have any luck with Winnie?"

48
00:02:57.527 --> 00:02:58.307
Mog asked.

49
00:02:59.368 --> 00:03:01.290
"No." Ben shook his head.

50
00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:04.272
"She told me what she told you—she's too busy.

51
00:03:04.673 --> 00:03:06.294
Her cousin is visiting for a few days."

52
00:03:06.314 --> 00:03:09.156
"Too bad," Mog said.

53
00:03:09.176 --> 00:03:10.537
"But it's okay.

54
00:03:10.918 --> 00:03:14.501
Jen said she'd love to join Team Black if Winnie can't do it."

55
00:03:16.562 --> 00:03:17.583
Ben felt worried.

56
00:03:17.603 --> 00:03:20.926
"Jen's a blob, Mog," he said.

57
00:03:20.946 --> 00:03:23.048
"Blobs can't run very fast.

58
00:03:24.569 --> 00:03:28.052
And there's a sack race and a cross-country race during Field Day."

59
00:03:29.532 --> 00:03:30.433
Mog shrugged.

60
00:03:30.453 --> 00:03:34.615
"Blobs are faster than zombies," he said.

61
00:03:34.635 --> 00:03:37.317
"And they don't drool.

62
00:03:37.637 --> 00:03:43.901
Besides"—he peered closely at Ben—"Jen's really nice.

63
00:03:44.201 --> 00:03:45.422
She'll be a good team member."

64
00:03:45.442 --> 00:03:47.763
"You're right."

65
00:03:48.343 --> 00:03:49.084
Ben nodded.

66
00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:51.925
"I guess I'm just getting carried away because of Zork.

67
00:03:53.106 --> 00:03:55.828
I can't stand the thought of losing to that guy!"

68
00:03:58.624 --> 00:04:02.366
Ten minutes later Team Black was warming up inside the gym.

69
00:04:05.708 --> 00:04:09.590
After only six push-ups, Waldo and Jen looked exhausted.

70
00:04:12.091 --> 00:04:14.613
Deb and Pixel looked only slightly better.

71
00:04:15.773 --> 00:04:17.434
Ben tried not to think about it.

72
00:04:17.454 --> 00:04:19.956
"We'll be fine," he told himself.

73
00:04:19.976 --> 00:04:22.397
"We can beat Team Orange."

74
00:04:24.358 --> 00:04:27.680
When warm-ups were over, Mog gathered the team together.

75
00:04:28.884 --> 00:04:30.525
"Great warm-up, everybody.

76
00:04:30.965 --> 00:04:34.887
Now let's start practicing for the slime ball toss," he said.

77
00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:39.810
"I don't have any slime balls, but we can practice with dodo eggs.

78
00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.511
I got them from the cafeteria."

79
00:04:43.852 --> 00:04:45.973
"Ooh!" Jen squealed.

80
00:04:45.993 --> 00:04:48.515
"I love catching slime!

81
00:04:48.535 --> 00:04:51.036
I can't wait till tomorrow."

82
00:04:52.257 --> 00:04:53.437
Mog looked at Waldo.

83
00:04:53.457 --> 00:04:55.558
"Just remember—Mr.

84
00:04:55.639 --> 00:04:58.180
Gwarg said no magic tomorrow."

85
00:04:59.584 --> 00:05:01.205
"Got it," Waldo murmured.

86
00:05:01.225 --> 00:05:06.248
"Good." Mog quickly went over the rules for the practice game.

87
00:05:06.268 --> 00:05:09.149
"If the egg cracks, you're out.

88
00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.511
Now everybody spread out a little bit."

89
00:05:13.652 --> 00:05:18.775
Team Black tossed a dodo egg around, being very careful not to drop it or crack it.

90
00:05:19.615 --> 00:05:24.678
Mog called out a few tips, and Ben had to admit that Mog had been right about Waldo.

91
00:05:25.298 --> 00:05:28.060
The wizard was pretty good at tossing and catching the egg.

92
00:05:29.452 --> 00:05:34.716
Before long, some other monsters wandered into the gym to watch Team Black practice.

93
00:05:34.736 --> 00:05:37.419
"This is actually going pretty well!"

94
00:05:37.699 --> 00:05:38.760
Ben thought with relief.

95
00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:43.884
Suddenly the gym doors opened again, and Serena sauntered in.

96
00:05:44.685 --> 00:05:48.027
Winnie hurried in right behind her cousin, trying to keep up.

97
00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:52.111
A few monsters gasped when they spotted the beautiful witch.

98
00:05:53.512 --> 00:05:58.336
As Mog turned to see what was causing the commotion, the dodo egg flew from his hand.

99
00:05:58.973 --> 00:06:02.329
It sailed through the air—heading straight for Waldo's face!
